    {
      "id": "u_0952cb964eb2214cc82ca481_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "One of the core features of Trilium is that it supports multiple types of notes, depending on the need.",
      "sourceHash": "0952cb964eb2214cc82ca481be39aa1fc744192fe04bad5256bf1ec3ea8fe22a",
      "context": "Note Types",
      "contextHash": "e369d88178077b4874c99f806436aab7fe11720874338548ff955bd4b8b84cbb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c16010460d051d4c18729507_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The default note type in Trilium (e.g. when creating a new note) is __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__, since it's for general use.",
      "sourceHash": "c16010460d051d4c18729507827475e48a406a0ae6bdbd1309e54e39d9576809",
      "context": "Note Types > Creating a new note with a different type via the note tree",
      "contextHash": "013ad4892df36448848d0beb2adc516951c87d6eb0809bc0487c4e5736dedd7a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1599216428c5e81ace6c40bf_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To create a new note of a different type, head to the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and right click an existing note where to place the new one and select:",
      "sourceHash": "1599216428c5e81ace6c40bf9d273406f4907cc05a8cf7dd9891a0fcc84809f7",
      "context": "Note Types > Creating a new note with a different type via the note tree",
      "contextHash": "013ad4892df36448848d0beb2adc516951c87d6eb0809bc0487c4e5736dedd7a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_970ced984ac948248c649a95_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Insert note after__TRILIUM_PH_1__, to put the new note underneath the one selected.",
      "sourceHash": "970ced984ac948248c649a9586d4421f8e0c1409b2090b21d8639c6cc181ba97",
      "context": "Note Types > Creating a new note with a different type via the note tree",
      "contextHash": "013ad4892df36448848d0beb2adc516951c87d6eb0809bc0487c4e5736dedd7a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_db4d9c0d46e3c5e41f8213fd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Insert child note__TRILIUM_PH_1__, to insert the note as a child of the selected note.",
      "sourceHash": "db4d9c0d46e3c5e41f8213fd17591e11431911690137c14b5104116fc112db40",
      "context": "Note Types > Creating a new note with a different type via the note tree",
      "contextHash": "013ad4892df36448848d0beb2adc516951c87d6eb0809bc0487c4e5736dedd7a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_59cc1d42d2229688de611ca0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The note types created less often, __TRILIUM_PH_0__Saved Search__TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__Render Note__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Web View__TRILIUM_PH_5__ and __TRILIUM_PH_6__Note Map__TRILIUM_PH_7__, are in the __TRILIUM_PH_8__More__TRILIUM_PH_9__ submenu.",
      "sourceHash": "59cc1d42d2229688de611ca00e7b7de65810ddf0effe8fde7ff2eb1ca244b213",
      "context": "Note Types > Creating a new note with a different type via the note tree",
      "contextHash": "013ad4892df36448848d0beb2adc516951c87d6eb0809bc0487c4e5736dedd7a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_932ec410ae7f9139645c14cc_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When adding a __TRILIUM_PH_0__link__TRILIUM_PH_1__ in a __TRILIUM_PH_2__Text__TRILIUM_PH_3__ note, type the desired title of the new note and press Enter. Afterwards the type of the note will be asked.",
      "sourceHash": "932ec410ae7f9139645c14cc9302784733287a4299817908a1df422dedc48c7f",
      "context": "Note Types > Creating a new note of a different type via add link or new tab",
      "contextHash": "b92011a6abef510d2a1acdbe9a2f659d92c58ac7bf6d81e7ca2a6febdd6a509f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1ce66212fa745b3586be9870_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Similarly, when creating a new tab, type the desired title and press Enter.",
      "sourceHash": "1ce66212fa745b3586be98700553eb6594ab5062a44c584fcb968261e181d878",
      "context": "Note Types > Creating a new note of a different type via add link or new tab",
      "contextHash": "b92011a6abef510d2a1acdbe9a2f659d92c58ac7bf6d81e7ca2a6febdd6a509f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b87d26f14fe3dc34988136e0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The note type is chosen from the same menu as in the note tree, with its submenus (code languages, snippets, collections and the note types created less often) and its search box: type to narrow the list, then press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to create the first match. __TRILIUM_PH_2__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_3__ right away creates a Text note.",
      "sourceHash": "b87d26f14fe3dc34988136e0f1d6f4aa67d98a916a71190ec00d693e74bd0da8",
      "context": "Note Types > Creating a new note of a different type via add link or new tab",
      "contextHash": "b92011a6abef510d2a1acdbe9a2f659d92c58ac7bf6d81e7ca2a6febdd6a509f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_69221120c4a9d60f77046eb8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "It is possible to change the type of a note after it has been created via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Note type__TRILIUM_PH_3__. This feature can also be used to edit the __TRILIUM_PH_4__source of a note__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "69221120c4a9d60f77046eb8419dfff2a290a0811825512116afa469a3ca9327",
      "context": "Note Types > Changing the type of a note",
      "contextHash": "1e442a1e80e908a6d93b9f4eba119d4fa17dcd0949ac318aed9507a363b3235f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1ff48eb41720e02a521057ce_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Note that it's generally a good idea to change the note type only if the note is empty",
      "sourceHash": "1ff48eb41720e02a521057ce0fa003973e36abf328e2a78dbfa56068f580c510",
      "context": "Note Types > Changing the type of a note",
      "contextHash": "1e442a1e80e908a6d93b9f4eba119d4fa17dcd0949ac318aed9507a363b3235f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
